 "question": "Are a layout's rows fixed?",
 "answer": "No. Rows vary by one with what came before and with the words. On p1 with one run of picks: 1 gives 13 or 14, 0 gives 9 or 10, 2 gives 8 or 9, 3 gives 7 or 8, 4 gives 7 or 8, 5 gives 5 or 6. Our table is fixed at 9, 13, 8, 9, 9, 7.",
